    "innovation": "This paper uses climate model simulations to demonstrate that sustained sulfur dioxide emissions from the 2014 Nornahraun eruption in Iceland could produce a regional radiative forcing effect exceeding that of all current anthropogenic aerosols over the North Atlantic and Western Europe.",
